{60}{Well, I was cutting down some trees for firewood, seeing as winter is coming. Unfortunately though, my axe is broken and I need it repaired before I can cut down any more trees.}{Well, I was cutting down some trees for firewood, seeing as winter is coming. Unfortunately though, my axe is broken and I need it repaired before I can cut down any more trees.}{}{}{}{qu1005 1}
