{80}{[He looks at the axe your holding] Ahhh... Yes, that's it! As you can see it is badly broken. I've had it for a number of years now and it had become worn out and blunt because I've been using it so much. Next thing I know, SNAP! It broke just this afternoon.}{[He looks at the axe your holding] Ahhh... Yes, that's it! As you can see it is badly broken. I've had it for a number of years now and it had become worn out and blunt because I've been using it so much. Next thing I know, SNAP! It broke just this afternoon.}{}{}{}{}
