{90}{Yes that's it! Feel free to take it and get it repaired for me. I've had it for a number of years now and it had become worn out and blunt because I've been using it so much. Next thing I know, SNAP! It broke just this afternoon.}{Yes that's it! Feel free to take it and get it repaired for me. I've had it for a number of years now and it had become worn out and blunt because I've been using it so much. Next thing I know, SNAP! It broke just this afternoon.}{}{}{}{}
