{130}{You have? Well, could you drop it on the ground so that I can check if it's busted please? Er... If it is already on the ground, could you move it closer to me?}{You have? Well, could you drop it on the ground so that I can check if it's busted please? Er... If it is already on the ground, could you move it closer to me?}{}{}{}{}
{131}{Okay, I'll drop it on the ground for you.}{}{5}{in 2201}{0}{}
{132}{Okay, me drop it on da grownd for you.}{}{-4}{in 2201}{0}{}
