{134}{Uhhh... Why? Kan't you see dat it be fixed?}{}{-4}{in 2201, lf3 0}{140}{}
{135}{Sure, I'll drop it on the ground closer to you.}{}{5}{ni 2201}{0}{}
{136}{Uhuh, me drop it on da grownd neer you.}{}{-4}{ni 2201}{0}{}

{140}{[His eyes roll into the back of his head and he talks in a deep demonic tone] No I can't! There's no script action of 'Check if item named (num) is busted'. There's only the 'Check if (obj) is busted'. Now of course, I have to create a loop to find object named 2201 don't I? Then 'check if Current Looped Object is busted'.}{[His eyes roll into the back of his head and he talks in a deep demonic tone] No I can't! There's no script action of 'Check if item named (num) is busted'. There's only the 'Check if (obj) is busted'. Now of course, I have to create a loop to find object named 2201 don't I? Then 'check if Current Looped Object is busted'.}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
{141}{But WHY does the axe have to be on the ground?}{}{5}{}{150}{}
{142}{Buy why dos da axe haf to be on da grownd?}{}{-4}{}{150}{}
{143}{I'll just put the axe down now.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{144}{Me jus' put da axe down now.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}

{150}{Well, I can't 'Loop for every item in inventory' can I? So when I 'Loop for objects in Vicinity' it doesn't check in anyone's inventory! That's why the axe was on the ground in the first place. Although, that was actually so I could loop for it and damage it. You would've thought there'd be a 'Busted' flag for weapons huh?}{Well, I can't 'Loop for every item in inventory' can I? SO when I 'Loop for objects in Vicinity' it doesn't check in anyone's inventory! That's why the axe was on the ground in the first place. Although, that was actually so I could loop for it and damage it. You would've thought there'd be a 'Busted' flag for weapons huh?}{}{}{}{}
{151}{What ARE you talking about?}{}{5}{}{160}{}
{152}{Wat you be talkin' 'bout?}{}{-4}{}{160}{}
{153}{Err.... I'll just drop the axe. Okay?}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{154}{Uhhh.... Me jus' drop da axe. Okay?}{}{-4}{}{0}{}

{156}{May Interplay crumble before it's rape of Fallout!! NEVER will I buy Fallout Tactics 2! Fallout Tactics 1 was bad enough! By the GODS those missions were long...}{May Interplay crumble before it's rape of Fallout!! NEVER will I buy a Fallout Tactics 2! Fallout Tactics 1 was bad enough! By the GODS those missions were long...}{}{}{}{}

{160}{[He carries on as if he's a man possesed] Well, I've spent a whole day! One WHOLE DAY!! Trying to figure out how to do this quest. First of all, I wanted to 'bust' the axe with a flag. But I couldn't. So I had to loop for it and bust it with a script on my first heartbeat. Only to do that, the item has to be on the ground, it can't be in my inventory.}{[He carries on as if he's a man possesed] Well, I've spent a whole day! One WHOLE DAY!! Trying to figure out how to do this quest. First of all, I wanted to 'bust' the axe with a flag. But I couldn't. So I had to loop for it and bust it with a script on my first heartbeat. Only to do that, the item has to be on the ground, it can't be in my inventory.}{}{}{}{}
{161}{[Say nothing and let him continue]}{}{1}{}{170}{}
{162}{By the Gods! You're possesed by an evil demon! You have to DIE!!}{}{5}{}{0}{co, fl 156}
{163}{By da Gods! You be possessed by evil deeeman! You haf to DIE!!}{}{-4}{}{0}{co, fl 156}
{164}{Uhhh... Yessss.... All right... I'll put the axe down now...}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{165}{Uhhh... Yeahhhh.... Okay... Me put da axe down now...}{}{-4}{}{0}{}

{170}{[He continues as his eyes go blood red] Then, I wanted the PC to repair the axe, only to do that, I had to install the latest 1074 patch! That meant renaming WorldEd so that it didn't change it to the latest version which only reads from .dat files. Uncompressing and compressing a mod every time I load WorldEd just gets a bit too much.}{[He continues as his eyes go blood red] Then, I wanted the PC to repair the axe, only to do that, I had to install the latest 1074 patch! That meant renaming WorldEd so that it didn't change it to the latest version which only reads from .dat files. Uncompressing and compressing a mod every time I load WorldEd just gets a bit too much.}{}{}{}{}
{171}{[You've let him get this far.. So why not continue?]}{}{1}{}{180}{}

{180}{Then, once that was done, I realised that I couldn't check to see if item 2201 was busted if it was in inventory. So, I had two options. ONE: Drop the quest, but after spending so long on it already, I figured why not continue? Which was option TWO: Continue with the quest, but concoct some plan to make the PC drop the axe so that we can check if it's busted.}{Then, once that was done, I realised that I couldn't check to see if item 2201 was busted if it was in inventory. So, I had two options. ONE: Drop the quest, but after spending so long on it already, I figured why not continue? Which was option TWO: Continue with the quest, but concoct some plan to make the PC drop the axe so that we can check if it's busted.}{}{}{}{}
{181}{I'm dropping the axe now...}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{182}{Me drop da axe now...}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{183}{Oh please, by all means, don't stop there...}{}{5}{}{190}{}
{184}{Uhh.. Pleese kontinyoo, don't stop dair...}{}{-4}{}{190}{}

{190}{So, I decided to have the NPC ask the PC to drop the axe. Pretty stupid huh? Of course, now I bet I'll find some way of doing what I originally intended and make the NPC give you the axe. But then I thought... Seeing as I'm in the mood for writing, and it IS 2:00 AM in the morning... Why not write some out-of-character dialogue?}{So, I decided to have the NPC ask the PC to drop the axe. Pretty stupid huh? Of course, now I bet I'll find some way of doing what I originally intended and make the NPC give you the axe. But then I thought... Seeing as I'm in the mood for writing, and it IS 2:00 AM in the morning... Why not write some out-of-character dialogue?}{}{}{}{}
{191}{Yeah, why not?}{}{1}{}{200}{}
{192}{This is too stupid. I'll just drop the axe.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{193}{Dis is dum. Me jus' drop da axe.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}

{200}{So... What do you think of my mod so far? Pretty scripted huh? I mean, you can only get the next quest if you've done the first one. That's what you get when you don't plan it out properly in the beginning. OH BOY did I learn THAT lesson quickly!! I hope I don't make the same mistake for 'The Elven Saga'. No sir, that ones gonna be THOROUGHLY planned out...}{So... What do you think of my mod so far? Pretty scripted huh? I mean, you can only get the next quest if you've done the first one. That's what you get when you don't plan it out properly in the beginning. OH BOY did I learn THAT lesson quickly!! I hope I don't make the same mistake for 'The Elven Saga'. No ma'am, that ones gonna be THOROUGHLY planned out...}{}{}{}{}
{201}{Actually, I don't mind it being so scripted.}{}{5}{}{210}{}
{202}{Akshully, me not mind it bein' dat skripted.}{}{-4}{}{210}{}
{203}{Yeah, I think that's dumb, how everything is so scripted.}{}{5}{}{210}{}
{204}{Yep, me dink it be dum to haf every'ting so skripted.}{}{-4}{}{210}{}
{205}{True, it could be better. But hey, you live and learn.}{}{5}{}{210}{}
{206}{Uhuh, it koold be bettuh. Buy hay, you live and lern.}{}{-4}{}{210}{}
{207}{Well... You've just gone and ruined my gaming experience.}{}{5}{}{210}{}
{208}{Well... You haf jus' gone and roo-end my gaming expeeriense.}{}{-4}{}{210}{}

{209}{I've worked for more than 4 months on this! You could at least give me some credit!}{I've worked for more than 4 months on this! You could at least give me some credit!}{}{}{}{}

{210}{[His eyes roll back into their proper places and he talks normally once more] Huh? What? You say something?}{[His eyes roll back into their proper places and he talks normally once more] Huh? What? You say something?}{}{}{}{}
