{212}{Yep, me say dat me drop da axe on da grownd for you.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{213}{By the Gods you shall die!}{}{5}{}{0}{co, fl 209}
{214}{By da Gods you haf to die!}{}{-4}{}{0}{co, fl 209}

