{230}{Hmmm... [He looks you over] Yes, you seem to be capable of wielding an axe. Listen, take my axe and cut down the three big trees that are at the end of this path here. They can be a little tricky to cut down, you'll have to force yourself to attack them.}{Hmmm... [He looks you over] Yes, you seem to be capable of wielding an axe. Listen, take my axe and cut down the three big trees that are at the end of this path here. They can be a little tricky to cut down, you'll have to force yourself to attack them.}{}{}{}{qu1006 1}
