{240}{[He looks you over] No, perhaps if you come back when you have enough skill to wield an axe? Maybe I'll let you do it then. Handling an axe without the proper skill is very dangerous.}{[He looks you over] No, perhaps if you come back when you have enough skill to wield an axe? Maybe I'll let you do it then. Handling an axe without the proper skill is very dangerous.}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
{241}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{250}{Okay then, just grab my axe and get chopping. Like I said, these big trees can be a little tricky to cut down. Just make sure you force yourself to attack them okay?}{Okay then, just grab my axe and get chopping. Like I said, these big trees can be a little tricky to cut down. Just make sure you force yourself to attack them okay?}{}{}{}{qu1006 2}
{251}{A:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{260}{Yes I can see that! Well done! I must say, you have a very nice chopping action. Thank you for this, I'll now have plenty of wood to keep me nice and warm all through the winter. Oh, by the way, feel free to keep my axe. I won't be needing it. I think I'll buy a new one.}{Yes I can see that! Well done! I must say, you have a very nice chopping action. Thank you for this, I'll now have plenty of wood to keep me nice and warm all through the winter. Oh, by the way, feel free to keep my axe. I won't be needing it. I think I'll buy a new one.}{}{}{}{qu1006 4}
{261}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{270}{[He seems to swell with pride] Why yes, I am the Sheep farmer that attacked that horrible Mummy. I sure showed it a thing or two!}{[He seems to swell with pride] Why yes, I am the Sheep farmer that attacked that horrible Mummy. I sure showed it a thing or two!}{}{}{}{}
