{290}{You are? You must be nearly as brave as I am to do that! Why, I almost had that Mummy when I saw it that night, it was barely able to escape alive! Good thing I had my axe with me!}{You are? You must be nearly as brave as I am to do that! Why, I almost had that Mummy when I saw it that night, it was barely able to escape alive! Good thing I had my axe with me!}{}{}{}{}
