{300}{Hmmm.... Well... There was a bright moon the night that I saw it, so I was able to catch quite a good look at it. It's got putrid yellow skin covered with the occasional black, rotting fleshy spot and wrapped over all of that are slightly yellowed cloth wrappings. Here, this is the bit that I cut off of it [He rumages through his things and hands you a piece of cloth].}{Hmmm.... Well... There was a bright moon the night that I saw it, so I was able to catch quite a good look at it. It's got putrid yellow skin covered with the occasional black, rotting fleshy spot and wrapped over all of that are slightly yellowed cloth wrappings. Here, this is the bit that I cut off of it [He rumages through his things and hands you a piece of cloth].}{}{}{}{in -5801}
