{320}{It's got putrid yellow skin covered with the occasional black, rotting fleshy spot and wrapped over all of that are slightly yellowed cloth wrappings.}{It's got putrid yellow skin covered with the occasional black, rotting fleshy spot and wrapped over all of that are slightly yellowed cloth wrappings.}{}{}{}{}
{321}{K:}{}{1}{}{310}{}

{330}{Well, everyone in Grayhills believes that it's hiding up in the old abandoned silver mine outside of town. They're nothing more than a labyrinth of caves now. The Mayor arranged for some men to guard the entrance so that it if it came out, the men would be able to stop it attacking anyone. Of course, they're far too scared to actually go into the caves themselves and deal with the Mummy...}{Well, everyone in Grayhills believes that it's hiding up in the old abandoned silver mine outside of town. They're nothing more than a labyrinth of caves now. The Mayor arranged for some men to guard the entrance so that it if it came out, the men would be able to stop it attacking anyone. Of course, they're far too scared to actually go into the caves themselves and deal with the Mummy...}{}{}{}{qu1007 2, qu1004 4}
{331}{K:}{}{1}{}{310}{}

{340}{Yes, that's right. Just over there actually [He points towards his Sheep Farm]. I was hiding behind that wall when I heard a noise. I originally thought it was one of the local boys, little Tim. As soon as I thought he was close enough, I jumped out and found the Mummy instead. That's when I swung my axe and cut off the piece of cloth. The Mummy ran away after that.}{Yes, that's right. Just over there actually [He points towards his Sheep Farm]. I was hiding behind that wall when I heard a noise. I originally thought it was one of the local boys, little Tim. As soon as I thought he was close enough, I jumped out and found the Mummy instead. That's when I swung my axe and cut off the piece of cloth. The Mummy ran away after that.}{}{}{}{}
{341}{K:}{}{1}{}{310}{}

